      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/10-catfishes/10e-catfishes-from-asia/tachysurus_fulvidraco_en/",
      "html": "<p>The species is also often placed in the genus Pelteobagrus, but the international trade name is much more interesting: Chinese highway catfish! However, the scientific name is also impressive, because \"fulvidraco\" means \"red-golden dragon\".</p>"
